{"version":1,"content":"<p>來到萬聖節，首先要有主題裝扮，然後和朋友齊齊參加主題派對，邊飲邊食邊玩，部分主題活動除有裝扮造型選舉，就連愛寵都可以一起參加，大跳大叫一晚，釋放壓力最好不過。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;萌犬派對&lt;br/&gt;北角五星</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.763927+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T06:00:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_hash":"92c1669d372d5b89e066bb8013586704834f0a1aff97198db3199a67f8aa3f5d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}